==Release information==
The {{TCGP|Promo-B}} card was available via special wonder picks during the Mega Kangaskhan [[Wonder Pick Event (Mega Kangaskhan)|Wonder Pick Event]], which ran from April 17 to 27, 2026. Players could also obtain one Promo Card Exchange Ticket during the event, which could be redeemed in the {{TCGP|shop}} for one of the event's two cards until May 4, 2026.

