==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldean Fates|Gastly|55}} from the {{TCG|Paldean Fates}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Gastly}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Generations|Gastly|33}} from the {{TCG|Generations}} expansion.
*'''Mumble''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Great Encounters|Whismur|94}} from the {{TCG|Great Encounters}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

